		(descr "Good Display GDEY0213B74 2.13in e-paper (SSD1680), mechanical outline only, front side. Origin = glass centre. Glass 59.2x29.2x1.0, active area 48.55x23.70 starting 7.95 mm from the FPC-side glass edge (centred in Y). FPC 12.5 wide, 14.3 long, 0.3 thick, leaves the left short edge 8.15 mm from the top glass edge. Edge.Cuts: 1.4x17 rounded FPC fold slot per hardware/board.yaml (slot centre x=-32.3 rel. glass centre), covering the flex's 14.3 mm wide flare where it passes. 3D model: glass on 0.2 mm adhesive, FPC folded 180 deg through the slot to the back side.")
